{"id":"3f7769b0fc6d1261","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-counting-bijection.md","title":"有限结构上计数与双射游戏等价","display":"thm-counting-bijection — 有限结构上计数与双射游戏等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-counting-bijection","aliases":["29-thm-counting-bijection"],"display":"thm-counting-bijection — 有限结构上计数与双射游戏等价","depends_on":["[[29-df-counting-game]]","[[29-df-bijection-game]]","[[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 12.23 and Exercise 12.24, p.189, DjVu scan 204","source_basis":"陈述与题示已视觉核对；本条补给有限类型配对的独立归纳证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-counting-bijection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-counting-bijection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-counting-bijection — 有限结构上计数与双射游戏等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab516fb5dde9de22\" href=\"?note=ab516fb5dde9de22\" title=\"29-df-counting-game\">29-df-counting-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f0cbb7d365d6e3cd\" href=\"?note=f0cbb7d365d6e3cd\" title=\"29-df-bijection-game\">29-df-bijection-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"20e8f6e9b486343b\" href=\"?note=20e8f6e9b486343b\" title=\"29-thm-counting-game-ck\">29-thm-counting-game-ck</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 12.23 and Exercise 12.24, p.189, DjVu scan 204"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"陈述与题示已视觉核对；本条补给有限类型配对的独立归纳证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为非空有限结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}\">\\(W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{A,B}_{B,k,m}\">\\(W^{A,B}_{B,k,m}\\)</span> 分别取计数游戏与双射游戏的回溯关系；不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|=|B|\">\\(|A|=|B|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}(p)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W^{A,B}_{B,k,m}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}(p)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W^{A,B}_{B,k,m}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 12.23 与 Exercise 12.24，印刷页189、扫描页204，陈述及题示均已视觉核对。原书将证明留作练习；下面为本地证明。</p>\n<p>对剩余轮数归纳。零轮二者均等于原子合法性。双射获胜推出计数获胜：每个挑战集合用相应双射的像或原像回应，再用逆像或像回应所挑顶点；归纳假设将剩余双射胜势转为计数胜势。</p>\n<p>反向，假设还剩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+1\">\\(m+1\\)</span> 轮计数获胜。对选定的卵石 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>，按剩余秩至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k\">\\(C^k\\)</span> 公式划分两侧的候选落点。由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20e8f6e9b486343b\" href=\"?note=20e8f6e9b486343b\" title=\"29-thm-counting-game-ck\">29-thm-counting-game-ck</a>，当前秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+1\">\\(m+1\\)</span> 等价；其有限类型特征式外加一次计数量词，迫使每一类型在两侧的实现数相等。逐类型配对得域间双射；任意配对更新后仍秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 等价，故由游戏刻画和归纳假设成为剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 轮双射胜势。正轮时取全域的计数挑战还保证总域大小相等；零轮不添加该条件。证明的有限类型特征式仅针对两给定结构的有限候选点集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-counting-game","status":"resolved","id":"ab516fb5dde9de22","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-counting-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bijection-game","status":"resolved","id":"f0cbb7d365d6e3cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bijection-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-counting-game-ck","status":"resolved","id":"20e8f6e9b486343b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-counting-game-ck","status":"resolved","id":"20e8f6e9b486343b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"反向，假设还剩 $m+1$ 轮计数获胜。对选定的卵石 $i$，按剩余秩至多 $m$ 的 $C^k$ 公式划分两侧的候选落点。由 [[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]，当前秩 $m+1$ 等价；其有限类型特征式外加一次计数量词，迫使每一类型在两侧的实现数相等。逐类型配对得域间双射；任意配对更新后仍秩 $m$ 等价，故由游戏刻画和归纳假设成为剩余 $m$ 轮双射胜势。正轮时取全域的计数挑战还保证总域大小相等；零轮不添加该条件。证明的有限类型特征式仅针对两给定结构的有限候选点集合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}","display":false},{"tex":"W^{A,B}_{B,k,m}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|=|B|","display":false},{"tex":"W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}(p)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W^{A,B}_{B,k,m}(p).","display":true},{"tex":"m+1","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"C^k","display":false},{"tex":"m+1","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":1992,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-counting-game]]、[[29-df-bijection-game]]、[[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]、[[29-thm-counting-bijection]] — 计数与双射游戏"},{"id":"2985e9c09cdf49eb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-counting-bijection]]"},{"id":"6de56ec38d538277","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-counting-bijection|29-thm-counting-bijection]]"}],"outgoing":["ab516fb5dde9de22","f0cbb7d365d6e3cd","20e8f6e9b486343b"]}